# 默认对文本文件自动归一化换行符，检出时统一为 LF（防止 macOS 与 Windows 跨分支切换出现满屏换行符冲突）
* text=auto eol=lf

# Python / Web 前端 / 文档 / GitHub Actions 明确使用 LF
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理与脚本强制保留 CRLF，确保 cmd.exe / PowerShell 正常解析
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件禁止 Git 进行文本转换或行尾替换
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary

